* Vi is the input voltage source
Vi 9 7 DC 0

* Ii is the input current source (not explicitly shown in the netlist)
Ii 9 0 DC 0

* Resistor Rπ
Rpi 9 6 Rpi_value

* Current-controlled current source
Gm 6 0 6 7 Gm_value

* Resistor ro
ro 6 8 ro_value

* Resistor RC
RC 8 33 RC_value

* Vo is the output voltage source
Vo 33 0 DC 0

* Io is the output current source (connected at Vo node)
Io 33 0 DC 0

* End of Netlist